("Family","Siblings, parents, cousins, in-laws. The hardest circle for most people, and the one with the longest history attached."),
("Fellowship","People you know from church who are on the edges &mdash; attending, not connected. They are the most likely yes in the room."),
("Firm","Work. The person two desks over you have never invited to anything, and the one you have prayed for without ever saying a word to them."),
("Fun","The gym, the team, the hobby, the group chat, the neighbors you see on Saturday mornings. The circle almost nobody thinks of, and often the warmest."),
